{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n またまた\n めいめいと自撮りの練習しました！\n \n \n めいめいの\n 表情と手の真似をしながら\n 撮りました✨✨\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNAFEJWYM1QY36NYNFDQ0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNBF3A1JMRGCQ79KYAH4E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNCG37N5KJ05ANNPMQXJ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n まずは定番のぶりっ子ポーズと一緒に\n めいめいの表情をお手本に真似を！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNDDYPGBQ5CQP5W4EPW9E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ここからは\n 髪の毛を触りながらパシャパシャ\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNECF8PV02FF1MA5G52H4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNFDP5Q20X7B3ZHPRDATW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNGDVTQPFJXJTD332DZSN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNHC4GNVW3F74B7NSNZDR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNJA6YPVQTW6P2C4W8851","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 連写したので\n 割とナチュラルな表情が\n 撮れた気がします！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNKACXE65YBXSTCCZ0587","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNMAPEC446DYV9V2ZSF31","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n でもやっぱり\n 静止して撮ると\n 表情が固い！\n \n どうしたら\n ナチュラルな表情で\n 撮れるのでしょうか！？\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFNNACYTZJSG321CCKS37V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n めいめい先生\n とても自然な笑